WEBVTT

00:16:26.307 --> 00:16:30.383
we will ultimately not be judged
by our technology,

00:16:30.407 --> 00:16:32.661
we won't be judged by our design,

00:16:32.685 --> 00:16:35.034
we won't be judged
by our intellect and reason.

00:16:35.058 --> 00:16:38.630
Ultimately, you judge
the character of a society

00:16:38.654 --> 00:16:41.919
not by how they treat their rich
and the powerful and the privileged,

00:16:41.943 --> 00:16:43.665
but by how they treat the poor,

00:16:43.689 --> 00:16:45.026
the condemned,

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:46.321
the incarcerated.

00:16:46.345 --> 00:16:47.726
Because it's in that nexus

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:50.996
that we actually begin to understand
truly profound things

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:52.670
about who we are.

00:16:54.535 --> 00:16:56.036
I sometimes get out of balance.

00:16:56.060 --> 00:16:57.272
I'll end with this story.

00:16:57.296 --> 00:16:58.678
I sometimes push too hard.

00:16:58.702 --> 00:17:00.726
I do get tired, as we all do.